# The assessment of AGT-002 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# AGT-002: "Agents shall return structured plans, changes, claims, tests, requested
# verification, assumptions, and unresolved questions." Seven named return-shape elements.
#
# `WorkResult` (`nomos-agent-contracts`, since P13-AGT-001-002-TASK-ENVELOPE-WORK-RESULT)
# is a real, tested type bundling six fields that cover all seven named elements: `plan`
# and `changes` are one artifact because a `CorrectionPlan`'s own candidates each carry
# their `ChangeSet`; `claims` is `Vec<Finding>`; `tests` and `requested_verification` reuse
# `VerificationPredicate`; `assumptions` and `unresolved_questions` are the two genuinely
# new pieces its own doc comment says no existing type covered. Its own tests construct
# both a full response and a judgment-only one (`plan: None`, per `OD-CONTRACTS-003`) that
# proposes no change.
#
# What is not yet true: nothing returns one through a real agent run.
# `nomos-agent-executor-claude-code`'s own module doc states plainly it "does not assemble a
# `nomos_agent_contracts::WorkResult`" -- the one real `AgentExecutor` still hands back a
# free-text response this crate does not attempt to map onto `claims`/`assumptions`/
# `unresolved_questions`, because no honest general mapping from prose to those fields
# exists. `P42-AGENT-STRUCTURED-WORKRESULT` is the open item for that gap. So the type this
# requirement's "structured response" describes is real and bundles what it must, but
# "Agents shall return" it is not yet true of any agent run in this workspace.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/agent/nomos-agent-contracts/src/work_result.rs#WorkResult
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/correction_plan.rs#CorrectionPlan
site: crates/corrections/nomos-corrections/src/change_set.rs#ChangeSet
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/reporting/finding.rs#Finding
site: crates/substrate/nomos-scope-verification/src/verification_predicate.rs#VerificationPredicate
gap: crates/agent/nomos-agent-executor-claude-code/src/lib.rs#does not assemble a
